# Line-ending governance (portability).
#
# Content-addressed artifacts MUST stay byte-exact: a gene is its SHA-256, and the
# signed index is verified against exact bytes. If git normalizes line endings on
# checkout (e.g. Windows core.autocrlf), every hash/signature check breaks.
* text=auto eol=lf
genes/* -text
.akashic_index.json -text
.akashic_index.json.sig -text